  data: {
    LLM: "As the caller, choose a suit that is both long (many cards) and strong (high cards). If you don't reveal too early, you might catch an opponent's Ace with a low trump.\n\nIf your partner is the caller, try to lead suits where you have strength to draw out defenders' cards before the trump is revealed.\n\nDefenders should attempt to force the trump reveal by leading suits they suspect the caller is short in. This removes the 'ambush' potential of the hidden suit.",
    Player: "As the caller, choose a suit that is both long (many cards) and strong (high cards). If you don't reveal too early, you might catch an opponent's Ace with a low trump.\n\nIf your partner is the caller, try to lead suits where you have strength to draw out defenders' cards before the trump is revealed.\n\nDefenders should attempt to force the trump reveal by leading suits they suspect the caller is short in. This removes the 'ambush' potential of the hidden suit.",
